  "meta": {
    "description": "Each month-end, rank the Select Sector SPDRs on trailing 6-month total return (no skip month) and hold the top 3 equal-weighted for one month. Sectors join the ranking once they have enough month-end history (XLRE 2016, XLC 2018). Optional Faber (2010) hedge: 100% BIL when SPY is at or below its 10-month SMA. Run as 4 equal tranches deciding 5 sessions apart, to remove rebalance-timing luck.",
